    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Zenatria, a vibrant world with wondrous sights. However, the forces of darkness have encroached on your homeland.<br><br>Work together with your allies referencing the traditional fantasy archetypes. Guide our heroes and show them where to defend and utilize your strategic skills to keep the people of this world safe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928010/extras/5877a3a959d63fb85965add4a2af4e64.webp?t=1713716210\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development:</strong></h2>We plan on releasing updates every year with new enemies, features, and gameplay.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environments:</strong></h2>Play within dynamic and exciting environments that will test your strategy to overcome obstacles. <br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong></h2>Defend against slimes, goblins, dragons and many more influenced by fantasy culture and storytelling.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Towers:</strong></h2> Place towers that are inspired from well known fantasy archetypes to help keep the town safe.</li></ul>",
